  "status": "Refused",
  "description": "Relocation of existing car parking spaces at rear, relocation of refuse bins at rear, installation of new fence and gate at rear and installation of 7 storage container units at the rear of existing property.",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;The proposed seven self-storage container units would\r\nintroduce a poorly integrated and incompatible B8 use within the designated local\r\nparade, resulting in a segregated planning unit that would fail to support the\r\nvitality and coherent operation of the premises on the parade in addition to\r\ndetrimental impacts on &amp;nbsp;the existing residential\r\n&amp;nbsp;occupiers of the site. As such, the\r\nproposal is contrary to Policy LE1(C) of the Harrow Local Plan 2021–2041 (2026).&amp;nbsp;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;The development would provide inadequate parking provision and\r\na highly constrained access arrangement to existing residential occupiers and commercial\r\nusers of the proposed commercial units. As such, the proposal is contrary to policy\r\nD13 of the London Plan (2021) and Policies GR3B and M2&lt;b&gt; &lt;/b&gt;of the Harrow\r\nLocal Plan 2021–2041 (2026).&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,sans-serif;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nAptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-GB;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA&quot;&gt;The\r\nproposed development would restrict and constrain the functionality and servicing\r\nof the host premises impacting its viability and scope of future commercial uses.\r\nAs such, the development is contrary policies GR1 and SP 04 of the Harrow Local\r\nPlan 2021–2041 (2026)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
